Third-party software
====================

firmware/StepMother2/ (the RP2040 firmware) is built against, and not
distributed with, the Raspberry Pi Pico SDK 2.1.1 (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c)
Raspberry Pi (Trading) Ltd.) and TinyUSB (MIT, Copyright (c) hathach, tinyusb.org
and contributors), which CI fetches at build time. The resulting firmware image
contains code from both; their license texts are in those projects.

firmware/StepMother/vendor/ contains a subset of PJRC Teensyduino 1.62.0,
patched locally at build time by firmware/StepMother/tools/build_teensy.py.
